<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Condemn</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 35)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast condemn &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>You call on the dark forces of the underworld to hinder the target. For ten 
minutes their strength, dexterity, brain and divine power are all lowered: a 
point or two at first, up to ten points for a master. The dark twin of bless.
</p><p>Name your target: without one, the spell falls on yourself. Against another 
player, you both must have signed the Book of Blood. Casting it on someone 
starts a fight. Someone already condemned can't be condemned more. You must 
have practiced the spell to use it, even from a scroll or staff. You must be 
standing.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
